  "bio": "Rio Chanel is a revered tattoo artist based in Portland, United States, known particularly for their exquisite floral, illustrative, and vegan tattoo designs. They are the head creator at QUANTUM.EARTH.MEDICINE and specialize in trauma-informed body tattoos, offering a unique and empathetic approach to their craft. Clients regard Rio not only for their extraordinary skill level but also for their professionalism in every aspect of their work, ensuring a respectful and profound tattooing experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Portland, Oregon, United States"
